@startuml quiz_module_diagram
title Frontend - Quiz module diagram

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide circle
hide empty members

package "Pages" {
  class PatternQuizPage
  class QuizDashboardPage
}

package "Hooks" {
  class usePatternQuiz <<hook>>
  class usePatternQuizProgress <<hook>>
  class useQuizDashboard <<hook>>
}

package "Quiz logic" {
  class quizUtils <<utils>>
}

package "Static data" {
  class fallbackQuizzes
}

package "HTTP client" {
  class api <<http client>>
}

package "Shared components" {
  class CollapsiblePanel
}

PatternQuizPage --> usePatternQuiz
PatternQuizPage --> usePatternQuizProgress
PatternQuizPage --> api
PatternQuizPage --> quizUtils
PatternQuizPage --> CollapsiblePanel

QuizDashboardPage --> useQuizDashboard

usePatternQuiz --> api
usePatternQuiz --> fallbackQuizzes
usePatternQuiz --> quizUtils
usePatternQuizProgress --> api
useQuizDashboard --> api

quizUtils ..> fallbackQuizzes

note bottom of PatternQuizPage
La page quiz gere :
- chargement du quiz
- etat des reponses
- evaluation locale question par question
- soumission finale au backend
- affichage du score et de la progression
end note

note bottom of usePatternQuiz
Le frontend degrade proprement :
quiz backend si disponible,
sinon fallback local normalise.
end note

@enduml
